{"id": 264, "title": {"raw": "Medical Aesthetics", "rendered": "Medical Aesthetics"}, "content": {"raw": "<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">Medical aesthetics offers non-surgical treatments to smooth lines, restore volume and refresh the skin, with little or no downtime. Treatments are carried out by qualified doctors and planned to keep your natural expression.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":872,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-aesthetics-326.jpg\" alt=\"Gloved hands framing a woman's face\" class=\"wp-image-872\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Medical aesthetic treatments</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1302,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/kosmetische-behandlung-im-klinikambiente-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Botox treatment on the forehead in a clinic\" class=\"wp-image-1302\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Botox (Botulinum Toxin)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Relaxes the muscles that cause expression lines \u2013 forehead lines, frown lines, crow's feet, lines around the lips, at the corners of the mouth and on the nose (bunny lines) \u2013 and neck bands. It can also be used for a subtle brow lift.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Medical uses include reducing excessive sweating (hyperhidrosis) and easing jaw tension related to teeth grinding.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1303,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-gm5mqngm5mqngm5m-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Dermal filler treatment of the lips\" class=\"wp-image-1303\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dermal Fillers</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Hyaluronic acid fillers restore volume and smooth folds. The effect is visible straight away and usually lasts about 6\u201318 months, depending on the product. Common areas:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Nasolabial folds (smile lines)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Cheeks and temples</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lips: volume, definition and hydration</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Chin and jawline contouring</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1304,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-1l8n6g1l8n6g1l8n-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Skin mesotherapy treatment on the face\" class=\"wp-image-1304\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Skin Mesotherapy</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Micro-injections deliver vitamins, minerals, amino acids and other nourishing substances directly into the skin, for skin rejuvenation, cellulite or localised fat. Several sessions give the best results; downtime is minimal.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1473,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/luxuriose-spa-seren-mit-orchidee-und-pinsel-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Unlabelled serum vials, dropper bottle and brush for an exosome skin treatment\" class=\"wp-image-1473\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Exosome Skin Treatments</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Exosomes deliver growth factors and proteins to skin cells to support regeneration and collagen production. Applied after microneedling, laser or radiofrequency treatments, they help the skin recover and look brighter, firmer and smoother.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":1315,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/blutplasma-rohrchen-im-labor-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Blood plasma tubes prepared for PRP treatment\" class=\"wp-image-1315\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">PRP (Platelet-Rich Plasma)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A small amount of your own blood is processed in a centrifuge to obtain plasma rich in platelets and growth factors. Applied to or injected into the skin, it supports collagen production and skin regeneration. PRP is also used on the scalp for thinning hair.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":2432,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/microneedling-skin-renewal.jpg\" alt=\"Woman with fresh, glowing skin and closed eyes in the sunlight\" class=\"wp-image-2432\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Microneedling</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Very fine, sterile needles create tiny controlled channels in the top layer of the skin, which stimulates the production of new collagen and elastin. Used for acne scars, enlarged pores and uneven skin texture \u2013 often combined with PRP or serums.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-steps\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Contact us and tell us what you are interested in. We advise you and refer you to the right specialist in T\u00fcrkiye for an online consultation. Medical documents go directly to the doctor, only on request.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-cta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your aesthetic treatment with confidence</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-whatsapp\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-disclaimer\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->", "rendered": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-e35d3e13 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"medlux-lead wp-block-paragraph\">Medical aesthetics offers non-surgical treatments to smooth lines, restore volume and refresh the skin, with little or no downtime. Treatments are carried out by qualified doctors and planned to keep your natural expression.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-aesthetics-326.jpg\" alt=\"Gloved hands framing a woman's face\" class=\"wp-image-872\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-aesthetics-326.jpg 1600w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-aesthetics-326-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-aesthetics-326-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-aesthetics-326-768x512.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-aesthetics-326-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-aesthetics-326-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Medical aesthetic treatments</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/kosmetische-behandlung-im-klinikambiente-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Botox treatment on the forehead in a clinic\" class=\"wp-image-1302\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/kosmetische-behandlung-im-klinikambiente-opt.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/kosmetische-behandlung-im-klinikambiente-opt-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/kosmetische-behandlung-im-klinikambiente-opt-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/kosmetische-behandlung-im-klinikambiente-opt-768x512.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/kosmetische-behandlung-im-klinikambiente-opt-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Botox (Botulinum Toxin)</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Relaxes the muscles that cause expression lines \u2013 forehead lines, frown lines, crow&#8217;s feet, lines around the lips, at the corners of the mouth and on the nose (bunny lines) \u2013 and neck bands. It can also be used for a subtle brow lift.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Medical uses include reducing excessive sweating (hyperhidrosis) and easing jaw tension related to teeth grinding.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-gm5mqngm5mqngm5m-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Dermal filler treatment of the lips\" class=\"wp-image-1303\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-gm5mqngm5mqngm5m-opt.jpg 1600w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-gm5mqngm5mqngm5m-opt-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-gm5mqngm5mqngm5m-opt-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-gm5mqngm5mqngm5m-opt-768x512.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-gm5mqngm5mqngm5m-opt-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-gm5mqngm5mqngm5m-opt-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Dermal Fillers</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Hyaluronic acid fillers restore volume and smooth folds. The effect is visible straight away and usually lasts about 6\u201318 months, depending on the product. Common areas:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Nasolabial folds (smile lines)</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Cheeks and temples</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Lips: volume, definition and hydration</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Chin and jawline contouring</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-1l8n6g1l8n6g1l8n-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Skin mesotherapy treatment on the face\" class=\"wp-image-1304\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-1l8n6g1l8n6g1l8n-opt.jpg 1600w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-1l8n6g1l8n6g1l8n-opt-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-1l8n6g1l8n6g1l8n-opt-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-1l8n6g1l8n6g1l8n-opt-768x512.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-1l8n6g1l8n6g1l8n-opt-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/gemini-generated-image-1l8n6g1l8n6g1l8n-opt-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Skin Mesotherapy</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Micro-injections deliver vitamins, minerals, amino acids and other nourishing substances directly into the skin, for skin rejuvenation, cellulite or localised fat. Several sessions give the best results; downtime is minimal.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1586\" height=\"992\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/luxuriose-spa-seren-mit-orchidee-und-pinsel-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Unlabelled serum vials, dropper bottle and brush for an exosome skin treatment\" class=\"wp-image-1473\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/luxuriose-spa-seren-mit-orchidee-und-pinsel-opt.jpg 1586w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/luxuriose-spa-seren-mit-orchidee-und-pinsel-opt-300x188.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/luxuriose-spa-seren-mit-orchidee-und-pinsel-opt-1024x640.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/luxuriose-spa-seren-mit-orchidee-und-pinsel-opt-768x480.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/luxuriose-spa-seren-mit-orchidee-und-pinsel-opt-1536x961.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/luxuriose-spa-seren-mit-orchidee-und-pinsel-opt-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1586px) 100vw, 1586px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Exosome Skin Treatments</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Exosomes deliver growth factors and proteins to skin cells to support regeneration and collagen production. Applied after microneedling, laser or radiofrequency treatments, they help the skin recover and look brighter, firmer and smoother.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/blutplasma-rohrchen-im-labor-opt.jpg\" alt=\"Blood plasma tubes prepared for PRP treatment\" class=\"wp-image-1315\" srcset=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/blutplasma-rohrchen-im-labor-opt.jpg 1536w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/blutplasma-rohrchen-im-labor-opt-300x200.jpg 300w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/blutplasma-rohrchen-im-labor-opt-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/blutplasma-rohrchen-im-labor-opt-768x512.jpg 768w, https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/blutplasma-rohrchen-im-labor-opt-18x12.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1536px) 100vw, 1536px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">PRP (Platelet-Rich Plasma)</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A small amount of your own blood is processed in a centrifuge to obtain plasma rich in platelets and growth factors. Applied to or injected into the skin, it supports collagen production and skin regeneration. PRP is also used on the scalp for thinning hair.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/microneedling-skin-renewal.jpg\" alt=\"Woman with fresh, glowing skin and closed eyes in the sunlight\" class=\"wp-image-2432\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Microneedling</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Very fine, sterile needles create tiny controlled channels in the top layer of the skin, which stimulates the production of new collagen and elastin. Used for acne scars, enlarged pores and uneven skin texture \u2013 often combined with PRP or serums.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Contact us and tell us what you are interested in. We advise you and refer you to the right specialist in T\u00fcrkiye for an online consultation. Medical documents go directly to the doctor, only on request.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your aesthetic treatment with confidence</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer wp-block-paragraph\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n</div>\n", "protected": false, "block_version": 1}}